  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in effective/coercive control by local actors leads to more inspections, seizures, convoying and route closures that directly reduce the sustainable throughput of commercial oil shipping through the chokepoint.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
