  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased coercive leverage by regional actors accelerates legislative and executive responses in affected states (export controls, stricter dual‑use rules and defensive compliance measures) aimed at limiting adversary access to AI technologies and hardening supply chains, raising regulatory intensity on AI firms.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
