  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in maritime security incidents prompts states, militaries and opportunistic actors to launch more offensive and defensive cyber operations (including targeting shipping, port infrastructure and AI-enabled logistics systems), raising the frequency and severity of cyberattacks on AI supply chains and deployed models.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
