  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in attacks, seizures or strikes produces immediate supply disruptions, emergency cargo diversions and spot-market re‑pricing as traders and refiners anticipate shortfalls, putting upward pressure on global crude prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_volatility</data>
