  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in hostile incidents in the Strait of Hormuz drives NATO/US to redeploy mobile air-defence batteries, spares and trained crews to protect bases, ships and supply lines in the Gulf, reducing operational air-defence availability for the Ukraine theater.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
