  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in drone attacks creates urgent demand for counter-UAS, autonomous sensing, and AI-enabled targeting/defense systems, which redirects venture and defense capital into AI startups and procurement programs.</data>
