  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising frequency and effectiveness of unmanned attacks on ships and port infrastructure raises insurers' and charterers' perceived hazard, producing higher insurance/war-risk surcharges and freight premiums.</data>
