  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Stricter controls on sensors, high‑end ICs and test equipment limit third‑party supplies that would otherwise be transferred to Russian radar and interceptor producers, reducing maintenance/production rates and degrading operational air‑defence capacity over the medium term.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
