<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::cross_border_capital" target="global_energy_volatility::maritime_transit_capacit" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Curtailment of cross‑border investment into port terminals, storage and ship‑repair capacity (driven by tech‑rivalry restrictions and screening) delays or cancels upgrades and reduces throughput, lowering effective maritime transit capacity for crude and products.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
