  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher resilience (diversified, audited vendors and rapid replacement paths) reduces reliance on fragile third-party providers and single points of failure that attackers exploit, lowering the frequency and impact of supply-chain and model-targeted cyber incidents.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
