<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::supply_chain_resilience" target="global_energy_volatility::global_oil_price_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Reduced resilience in tech and parts supply chains for refineries and offshore production (spare parts, control electronics) increases unplanned outages and limits run‑rates, tightening refined‑product and crude demand/supply balance and pushing up global oil prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_volatility</data>
