  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising tanker risk premiums increase transport costs and perceived operational risk for export‑dependent projects, prompting foreign investors and funds to scale back new cross‑border investments and strategic financing into export‑oriented tech assets.</data>
