  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in AI-enabled cyber incidents (sensor spoofing, data-poisoning, C2 compromises) directly degrades radar performance, missile guidance and command-and-control software, reducing operational availability and effectiveness of air-defence systems.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_governance_cyber_risk</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
